OL,3,GNEWSADetective admits 'upskirting' sex
OL,4,Aoffences against a child
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former detective has admitted taking
OL,7,Fpictures beneath the clothing of a
OL,8,Fchild without consent - also known as
OL,9,F"upskirting".
OL,11,FLee Harshey-Jones, 45, pleaded guilty
OL,12,Fto one charge of voyeurism and one of
OL,13,Fperverting the course of justice by
OL,14,Fapplying a factory reset to his mobile
OL,15,Fphone to conceal evidence on 11 June
OL,16,F2026, in Colwyn Bay, Conwy county.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
