OL,3,GNEWSADetective admits 'upskirting' sex
OL,4,Aoffences against a child
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was a detective constable and lead
OL,7,Finvestigator in the case of
OL,8,Ftwo-year-old Ethan Ives-Griffiths,
OL,9,Fwhose grandparents were jailed for
OL,10,Fmurder last year, and has given
OL,11,Fevidence in other high-profile murder
OL,12,Ftrials in north Wales.
OL,14,FHarshey-Jones was given conditional
OL,15,Fbail following a hearing at Chester
OL,16,FCrown Court, and will be sentenced on
OL,17,F19 November.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
